## Integration with Enterprise Framework

### Pre-Code Check

Before writing code, answer:

```
[ ] Does this need to exist?
[ ] Already in codebase?
[ ] Stdlib does it?
[ ] Native platform feature?
[ ] Installed dependency?
[ ] Can this be one line?
[ ] Minimum that works?
```

### Post-Code Check

```
[ ] No abstractions without explicit request
[ ] No new dependencies
[ ] No boilerplate
[ ] Deletion considered
[ ] Shortest working diff
[ ] ponytail: comment for intentional shortcuts
```

